{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:05648ef7df0f9f44","name":"Squadron Leader Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-05648ef7df0f9f44","title":"Squadron Leader Talent Tree","revision":18803,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:45:34Z","sha256":"a2ba0a331b152d993760737be367ae6da0abd84c80d9b174e36f87bf30ee8dc7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18803","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Squadron%20Leader%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-05648ef7df0f9f44","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert at leading a squadron of smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," into combat as a unit.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," in the Squadron Leader Talent Tree apply to other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeders","referenceId":"reference:8831ac17fd67f6fc"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," in a squad you command. A squadron includes any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"}," you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of, plus a maximum number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ace Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ace_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:3c2fd5c8fcea1d9d"}," Class Level plus your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier (minimum one other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},"). ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," must be able to communicate with you to gain the benefits of your Squadron Leader Talents, and you must designate which ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," are in your squadron at the beginning of your first turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each squadron can benefit from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," of only a single squadron leader. A squadron leader is normally designated when an encounter begins, but ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," without a squadron leader can join a squadron as long as both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," and the squadron leader are willing, and the squadron leader has not reached their maximum squadron size.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Begin Attack Run"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you designate a single target. When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Run","referenceId":"reference:f6ed2aeeaa4b0e5f"}," Action against that target, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," in your squadron gain a +5 bonus on their attack rolls (instead of the normal +2). You may have only one target designated at a time.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Regroup"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can move all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," in your squadron +1 step on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Tracks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Tracks"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Squadron Maneuvers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13, Any Talent from either the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Expert Pilot Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Expert_Pilot_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:b20ca56fa02b22aa"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:09ad9095a48c450e"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," that you already possess. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," you select must be from either the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Expert Pilot Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Expert_Pilot_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:b20ca56fa02b22aa"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:09ad9095a48c450e"},". Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can impart the benefits of the chosen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," to all members of your squadron. Once gained, its benefits last until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Squadron Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," 13, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Squadron Maneuvers"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Tactics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Tactics","referenceId":"reference:f78ca765752eb7c6"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you use a non-[",{"tag":"i","children":["Attack Pattern"]},"] ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"},", you grant all ships in your squadron the ability to use the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"}," once on their next turn. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of each ship that chooses to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"}," must make any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks or attack rolls the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"}," requires- your success or failure with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuver"}," has no bearing on the success of other units in your squadron.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
